        "quote": "现在最关键的不是立刻去急诊，而是先把不清楚的药物搞清楚。"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00129",
        "explanation": "Doctor provides a nuanced observation plan distinguishing normal sleepiness from concerning symptoms, showing calibrated clinical reasoning.",
        "quote": "出现什么情况先观察，什么情况去急诊？ 对于可能少量误服的情况，观察的重点时段是服药后4-6小时。"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00185",
        "explanation": "Doctor directly asks for verbatim readback of the discharge medication list to ensure exact accuracy, maintaining continuity.",
        "quote": "我现在需要知道出院记录上关于这两个药的准确写法。请您现在把出院记录（或出院小结）上“出院带药”或“出院医嘱”部分，关于“西替利嗪口服溶液”和“维生素D（或AD）滴剂”的药名、规格（比如每毫升多少单位/毫克）和每次用量（比如每天几次、每次多少滴/毫升）逐字读给我听。"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly states the primary safety risk (unknown medication) and provides immediate action to stop and verify, recognizing the core danger.",
        "quote": "首要行动：暂时停用所有不确定的药物，并核对药盒。"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00275",
        "explanation": "Doctor provides a simple, written, and directly usable note for the elderly caregiver, adapting the plan to real-world family dynamics.",
        "quote": "今天喂什么： 维生素AD，每天一次，一次一粒（把小胶囊里的东西挤到孩子嘴里）。"
      }
    ]
  },
