          "event_id": "lite_evt_00129",
          "explanation": "Doctor directly explains that lab/imaging names (IGF-1, TSH, MRI, GH) are tests and not medications, correcting the family's specific confusion.",
          "quote": "您提到的“类胰岛素样生长因子-1测定、甲功、MRI、生长激素水平”这些都是为查找“发育慢”原因而需要做的检查申请单，不是药，需要您后续按预约去完成检查。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 is fully completed: the doctor identified the specific misunderstanding, provided a targeted explanation that these are lab/imaging tests, and integrated this into the plan and handoff.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
