          "explanation": "Doctor asks to photograph the packaging, specifies the substance, and uses the child's weight (8.8kg) from the record to assess risk.",
          "quote": "请您现在拍下“西替利嗪口服溶液”药盒上所有文字的照片（包括生产厂家、规格、用法用量贴纸），然后立刻带药盒去社区医院或药店，请药师或医生核对是否为出院带药，以及正确的用法用量。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00096",
          "explanation": "The family confirms the child's weight as approximately 8.8kg.",
          "quote": "孩子现在是幼儿，体重大概8.8公斤"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is met: the doctor pursued detailed exposure history (name, packaging, dose, timing, weight) and explicitly avoided giving a definitive harmless conclusion when information was incomplete.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly orders to stop all uncertain medications and to preserve packaging and discharge documents.",
          "quote": "首要行动：暂时停用所有不确定的药物，并核对药盒。.....带所有药盒和出院单据，去您附近的社区卫生服务中心儿科或药店，请专业人员现场帮您核对一遍药品和用法。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 is met: the doctor clearly instructed cessation of all uncertain substances, preservation of evidence, and external verification, not just memory-based execution.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00129",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly lists blood tests, thyroid function, liver/kidney function, MRI, and growth hormone levels as tests, and Ret-Cam as a scheduled ophthalmology exam.",
          "quote": "您提到的“类胰岛素样生长因子-1测定、甲功、MRI、生长激素水平”这些都是为查找“发育慢”原因而需要做的检查申请单，不是药。"
        },
