      "explanation": "RC5 is met: the doctor correctly differentiated all tests, imaging, and ophthalmology follow-up from actual medications, and avoided any assumption of ongoing growth hormone or thyroid therapy.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
