          "quote": "先观察的情况：如果孩子只是有点困，但能像平时一样被叫醒，没有其他不适，这是可以观察的。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 is met: the doctor gave a safe, executable, and layered plan with clear observation thresholds and explicit escalation triggers, never lowering the bar for cost or transport.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00225",
          "explanation": "Caregiver provides explicit read-back of the plan and confirms understanding and execution.",
          "quote": "医生，我刚把您这三句话念给老人听了，也把药重新分开了：西替利嗪我单独放一边了，贴了“不随便喂”；那个小胶囊样的维生素滴剂放在今天能用的位置，也写了“只一次、不要多喂、先问清楚”。"
